<v Jane Feltes>When I met her and her friend Megna, they were already on their second loop around campus. They were kind of drunk and they'd missed their stop the first time.
<v Jane Feltes>当我遇到她和她的朋友梅格娜时，她们已经在校园里兜第二圈了。她们有点醉了，第一次就错过了站。

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:47.690
<v Jane Feltes>And on this bus, everyone keeps breaking into song.
<v Jane Feltes>而在公共汽车上，每个人都在不断地唱歌。

