00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:40.830
<v Female Student 4>That's not bad.
<v Female Student 4>那还不错。

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:41.710
<v Female Student 5>Oh, yum.
<v Female Student 5>噢，好吃。

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:42.930
<v Jane Feltes>What's in your fridge?
<v Jane Feltes>你冰箱里有什么？

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:52.820
<v Female  Student 4>Um, water, lemonade, tequila, Malibu, vodka, margarita mix, and cheese.
<v Female  Student 4>呃，水、柠檬水、龙舌兰、马利宝、伏特加、玛格丽特预调酒和奶酪。

00:16:52.820 --> 00:17:11.760
<v Ira Glass>But college students are underage, so a lot, maybe most, of drinking at Penn State is underage drinking. The bars in State College are actually very strict about under 21 drinking. You have to show a student ID. In lots of places they scan the ID. But there are other ways to get drunk. Everybody told us if you're too young for a bar, you go to a frat party.
<v Ira Glass>但大学生还没成年，所以很多，也许大部分在宾州立大学的饮酒是未成年饮酒。州立学院的酒吧实际上对21岁以下的饮酒非常严格。你必须出示学生证。在很多地方他们扫描ID。但还有其他方法喝醉。每个人都告诉我们，如果你还没到酒吧的年龄，你就去兄弟会派对。

